  <main>
    <h2>JPG Example: Bright Green Hill Landscape</h2>
    <figure>
      <img src="images/landscape.jpg" alt="A bright blue sky above a vivid green rolling hill.">
      <figcaption>JPG Example — an original example image made for this project.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <section>
      <h3>Image description</h3>
      <p>This colorful landscape shows a bright blue sky, white clouds, and a vivid green hill inspired by classic computer wallpaper imagery.</p>
      <h3>File type information</h3>
      <p>JPG, also called JPEG, is a compressed image format often used for photographs and colorful scenes. It reduces file size, although some image detail can be lost.</p>
      <h3>Why I chose this image</h3>
      <p>I chose this recognizable landscape style because it looks like classic desktop wallpaper and shows how JPG works well for colorful images.</p>
      <h3>Source</h3>
      <p>This is original artwork created for this assignment, so it does not use an outside image source.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer><p>CSIT 121 · Lab 04 · Web Image Formats</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
